KONOHAGAKURE — HOKAGE SUCCESSION RECORDS
Official lineage, Office of the Hokage

# | Title      | Name              | Clan/Note                | Disposition
1 | Shodai     | Hashirama Senju   | Senju, God of Shinobi    | Deceased
2 | Nidaime    | Tobirama Senju    | Senju, founded ANBU      | KIA, First War
3 | Sandaime   | Hiruzen Sarutobi  | The Professor            | KIA, Konoha Crush
4 | Yondaime   | Minato Namikaze   | Yellow Flash             | KIA, Nine-Tails
-- | (interim)  | Hiruzen Sarutobi  | second term              | see above
5 | Godaime    | Tsunade Senju     | Sannin, medical-nin      | Retired
6 | Rokudaime  | Kakashi Hatake    | Copy Ninja, ex-ANBU      | Retired
7 | Nanadaime  | Naruto Uzumaki    | Jinchuriki, Uzumaki      | In office

Note: Hiruzen Sarutobi served two non-consecutive terms, resuming
office after the death of the Fourth. Succession is confirmed by the
village council and the daimyo. Maintained by the Hokage's Office.
